# SyncForge AI - Frontend Environment Configurations Example
#
# IMPORTANT SECURITY WARNING:
# All environment variables prefixed with "VITE_" are processed by Vite and embedded
# directly into the client-side production JavaScript bundle. Therefore, they are
# PUBLICLY visible to anyone who inspects the browser bundle files.
#
# NEVER store credentials, database passwords, OAuth client secrets, or AI provider
# API secret keys in this file or any .env file in the frontend repository.
# These secrets must remain secure on your Spring Boot backend server.

# Base endpoint URL pointing to your Spring Boot REST API server
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080
